msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: gnome-shell-extension-monmux\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: https://github.com/leinardi/gnome-shell-extension-"
"monmux/issues\n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2026-09-11 11:34+0200\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-09-11 11:30+0200\n"
"Last-Translator: Roberto Leinardi <leinardi@gmail.com>\n"
"Language-Team: Italian\n"
"Language: it\n"
